            },
            {
                "id": 2,
                "question": "How do I withdraw my winnings?",
                "answer": "Go to Wallet > Withdraw, select an amount, and complete KYC if required. Withdrawals are processed within 24–48 hours.",
                "sort_order": 2
            },
            {
                "id": 3,
                "question": "Why is KYC required?",
                "answer": "KYC (Know Your Customer) is required by law for cash withdrawals. It helps us verify your identity and keep the platform secure. Higher KYC levels allow larger withdrawal limits.",
                "sort_order": 3
            },
            {
                "id": 4,
                "question": "How do I claim daily rewards?",
                "answer": "Log in daily and visit the Daily Rewards section. Claim your reward each day to progress through the 7-day ladder. Rewards are credited to your wallet instantly.",
                "sort_order": 4
            },
            {
                "id": 5,
                "question": "What Rummy games can I play?",
                "answer": "We offer Points Rummy, 101 Pool, 201 Pool, Deals, Spin & Go, and Practice. Each has different rules and contest types. Check the Games section for details.",
                "sort_order": 5
            },
            {
                "id": 6,
                "question": "How does the entry fee work?",
                "answer": "Each contest has an entry fee. Pay the fee to join; winners share the prize pool. Check contest details for entry amount and win potential before joining.",
                "sort_order": 6
            },
            {
                "id": 7,
                "question": "When do I receive my winnings?",
                "answer": "Winnings from games are credited to your wallet immediately after the contest ends. You can withdraw them after completing KYC if required.",
                "sort_order": 7
            },
            {
                "id": 8,
                "question": "Is my money and data safe?",
                "answer": "Yes. We use secure payment gateways and follow industry standards. Your personal and financial data is encrypted and never shared with third parties.",
                "sort_order": 8
            },
            {
                "id": 9,
                "question": "What payment methods do you accept?",
                "answer": "We accept UPI, debit cards, credit cards, and net banking for add cash. Withdrawal is processed to your verified bank account or UPI.",
                "sort_order": 9
            },
            {
                "id": 10,
                "question": "Is there a withdrawal limit?",
                "answer": "Withdrawal limits depend on your KYC level. Basic KYC allows moderate limits; full KYC enables higher withdrawal amounts. Check Wallet > Withdraw for options.",
                "sort_order": 10
            },
            {
                "id": 11,
                "question": "Can I play for free?",
                "answer": "Yes. Practice games let you play Rummy without real money. Use them to learn rules and improve your skills before joining cash contests.",
                "sort_order": 11
            },
            {
                "id": 12,
                "question": "How can I change my profile or avatar?",
                "answer": "Go to Profile/Settings and select an avatar from the available options. You can also update your display name and other details there.",
                "sort_order": 12
            },
            {
                "id": 13,
                "question": "I added cash but it did not reflect. What do I do?",
                "answer": "Add cash usually reflects within minutes. If it does not, check your transaction status in Wallet > Recharge History. If the payment succeeded but balance did not update, contact support with your order ID.",
